  "articleBody": "Before requesting an estimate, measure the bathroom, identify current mobility challenges, and decide which features are essential versus optional. Give the remodeling team photos, dimensions, fixture locations, and household preferences so the proposed layout can address clearances, shower access, support locations, storage, lighting, plumbing, electrical work, and permit needs.",
